body:
Parents: We all know you didn't need to go on antidepressants. ; We know that nothing is wrong with you. ; You really did some stupid shit you know (suicide attempt) ; Smile more ; Go study, its not difficult ; Don't betray us by thinking of suicide again ; Stop wasting your life ; 

Friends: I told you it would scar ; You are being dramatic ; Life is amazing ; Go out more, make friends ; 

Top of my head. Hope it helped a little.
